WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.480
Summer vacation. A time for children to shine like the sun,

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:08.840
play hard, work hard, and enjoy their youth!

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.420
Indeed, it begins tomorrow.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.590
I, too, must shine like the sun!

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.620
While enjoying my PriPara hunt!

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.870
Friends?

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:25.170
As seen here, 85.7% of PriPara-goers have made new friends there!

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:28.240
Ha! What rot.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.410
Okay, my dear Rina.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:38.640
On the matter of our beloved Paprika Academy's elementary students going to PriPara...

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.520
Confiscate, confiscate and confiscate more!

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.400
Like the light of the sun,

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.400
we will reveal their dark deeds!

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.500
Understood?

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:36.120
Keep a close look on the elementary schoolers for any signs of PriTickets.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:36.670
Yes ma'am.

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:37.920
Yes ma'am.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.990
See you next semester!

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.240
Close up, you!

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:54.220
Geez, this is why you should have taken some of your stuff home earlier.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:55.610
But...

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:58.430
What is it?

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:01.610
Well, Nao, actually...

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:03.020
I got a Pri—

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:04.030
I'll take that!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.950
My PriTicket!

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:07.910
Another!

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:10.960
Stop!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.330
I'm confiscating those!

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.800
Well, I'll just be...

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.370
Bye bye!

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.320
Bye bye...

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.180
What was she about to say?

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:32.190
Should any of you elementary students have
PriTickets <i>on hand</i>, please turn them in to us.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:32.780
Got none!

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:33.530
None in my hands!

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:34.410
Bye bye!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:35.500
Bye!

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.150
Good job guys!

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:39.380
Head Disciplinarian!

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:43.760
I don't think anyone's going to knowingly hand in their tickets for confiscation.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:48.550
Amamiya, I'm sure you're aware that possession of PriTickets is not, in fact, against any school rules.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.480
There's hardly any need to be any stricter than this about it.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:53.120
Your clemency is truly second to none, Head Disciplinarian!

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.920
Manaka from class 5-2, a word.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.230
Y-Yeah?

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:05.140
You don't have any PriTickets <i>on hand</i>, do you?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.100
Huh? Not one, Head Disciplinarian.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.850
<i>I mean I totally have one in my bag, but...</i>

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:15.800
<i>That doesn't count as "on hand", so it's not lying.</i>

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:17.240
In that case, you may go.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.440
Will do!

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:22.820
You lot! How goes the hunt?

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:24.030
Fine.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:26.490
I can feel them!

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:30.390
I must go patrol off-campus!

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:41.090
Summer vacation means more time for performing and boosting my idol rank!

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:45.590
One day, I'll be standing next to Sophie!

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.050
No time to lose!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.760
Gah, that sound!

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.270
Nooo!

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:01.590
That Manaka is most definitely suspicious.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:06.920
My PriTicket sensor tells me she must have some.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.970
This is the scent of those noodles that were served at lunch.

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:14.710
And this way, curry and rice.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:18.670
Oh no! My glorious nose sensor won't work through this!

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:22.460
Oh! You know where to go, Rina?

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:25.820
That way, is it?

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.090
Charge!

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.080
There she is!

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:30.300
I can smell it!

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.550
Oh, sorry!

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:37.070
No, that was my bad.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.780
You dropped your Friend Ticket.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:39.440
Huh?

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.490
This is mine...

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:43.860
What? Are you Eiko?

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.840
Yeah, I am...

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.970
I'm Lala!

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:50.500
What? Lala?

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:51.620
You're Lala!?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:52.880
Yeah!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.990
Wow, what a coincidence!

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:57.290
I'm so glad we met!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:02.750
But I never imagined my favorite idol was an elementary schooler!

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.210
Disappointed?

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:08.490
Of course not! We swapped Friend Tickets and all!

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:11.760
And you can sing even though you're so young...

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.720
Your voice is so lovely!

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.650
So you're a middle schooler.

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:19.440
Gulp!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.320
What's up?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:25.360
That's...

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:28.060
Paprika Academy's infamous Headmistress,

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.070
Ookanda Gloria...

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:33.190
Lala, are you being chased?

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.040
Yeah...

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:35.660
This way!

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.250
Over there!

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:46.530
This is no good! She'll find us for sure!

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:48.310
No, we'll be fine here!

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.430
There you are!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.870
I'm done for!

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:02.560
My feet won't move!?

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.020
See?

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.200
Can't... move...

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:16.000
Am I within 100 meters of a PriPara entrance?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.540
You can't stop me!

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:25.340
My hunt for PriTickets must go on!

00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:28.960
Now's our chance!

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:37.410
Headmistress Ookanda can't come within 100 meters of PriPara.

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:39.720
Her body can't take it for some reason.

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.740
Really...

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.580
You can't cheat your own body.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:44.360
I see.

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:48.720
You seem to know a lot about her.

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:50.280
She's pretty famous.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:53.990
Everyone always says Paprika Elementary Schoolers have a hard time.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.070
Yeah...

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:57.280
But I'll be fine!

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.970
Thanks for saving me, Eiko!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.950
What is it, Eiko?

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:11.890
I've got a tennis match tomorrow.

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:15.190
And my opponent is crazy strong!

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:21.520
The pressure is crushing me...

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:25.740
But I saw one your shows before a match a while back!

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:29.480
I felt really good that time and even won the match!

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.820
Against a player I'd never beaten before, too!

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:50.460
So I thought that if I could hear you sing that again, I could win tomorrow, too!

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:51.420
For real?

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.070
So please perform today!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:57.720
Yeah! I'll head straight to PriPara after I drop all my stuff off at home!

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:01.230
I'll be waiting! Promise, okay?

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:03.030
Yeah! Promise!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.020
I'm

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.000
HOME!?

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:12.900
Welcome back.

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:14.860
Welcome back!
Welcome backcellato!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.110
Why's the headmistress here?

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:20.530
Surprise home visit.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.290
Home visit?!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.410
You have such enthusiasm for your students!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.370
But of course.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:29.790
And might I ask to take a little peek into Lala's room?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:30.780
What!?

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:35.820
Go right ahead! We'll have your special pizza ready after that.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.260
Well, then. I'll just...

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.180
No no no no no!

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:54.110
<i>So please perform today! Promise, okay?</i>

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:57.220
Headmistress... isn't that enough?

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:58.200
Th-This is!?

00:09:58.650 --> 00:09:59.910
Autograph practice?

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:03.290
Manaka! You have been to PriPara!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.370
No no! That's just, uh...

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:10.040
Right! My dream is to become a sumo wrestler!

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:13.950
And I need to have an autograph ready for when I make it!

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:14.470
Bring it on!

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:15.610
Bring it on, bring it on!

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.260
Bring it on, bring it on, bring it on!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:18.760
Oh my.

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:21.720
So that's what it was?

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:22.680
Oh?

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:24.890
What's that box?

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:30.350
<i>I forgot! I have my PriTicket bag with a bunch of tickets in there!</i>

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:34.320
<i>I... I'm... I'm done for!</i>

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.890
<i>I'm done for!</i>

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.290
Oh, it's empty?

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.830
Huh? Empty?

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:49.960
Headmistress!

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.960
The pizza you ordered is done!

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.330
Okay! I'll be right there!

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.170
It really is...

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.110
Then where are my PriTickets?

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.300
Non?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.600
You... Oh!

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:07.640
That's...

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:11.610
I hid it for you. Don't forget who your savior is!

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:12.960
Thanks!

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:15.320
You finally got some PriTickets!

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.850
Shush!

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:18.240
Sorry I kept it a secret.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:21.640
You can get me Pink Actress' autograph as thanks!

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:22.600
What?

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.700
You don't wanna? Well then...

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.540
Oh, Headmist—

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.660
I get it! I get it!

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.500
Glad we're in agreement.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.210
Geez... Hm?

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:38.170
Oh no! Eiko's waiting for me!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.460
Truly an excellent pizza.

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:43.010
<i>Phew, she's headed back already.</i>

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.710
I'd be most delighted to come again sometime.

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:46.680
Whaaat?

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:50.180
Of course, you're welcome any time.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.190
Thank you.

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:56.350
She's so dedicated to her work.

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:57.360
Indeed.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:01.360
Oh yeah! I gotta go out for a bit!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.500
Lala's gonna be late...

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:13.730
Yes?

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.130
Whaddya think yer doin'?

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.090
Ya gon' perform a bunch and rank up like a right loon, innit?

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:22.050
Of course! I'm on my way right now!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:25.930
Bzzt! The entries are closin'! Game obear, missy!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.180
Whaat!?

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:30.100
Welcome to Prism Stone.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.850
Unfortunately, entries are closed for today.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.980
Can't you make an exception?

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.590
It's how the system is set up.
I can't really do anything about it.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:40.100
Not even if it's only been a minute or two?

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:41.620
Well, it's actually been 15 minutes.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:44.780
I couldn't make it...

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:46.750
Lala...

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.430
Eiko!

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:55.370
You promised you would...

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:56.750
Well...

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:59.960
There's no way I'm gonna make it through tomorrow's game now!

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:04.340
My opponent's a real veteran! She looks super strong!

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:06.180
Eiko!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:11.120
Eiko! I'll make sure to get one in before your game tomorrow!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:13.920
I'll make it for sure!

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.350
I promise!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.560
Eiko!

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:22.150
I... promise...

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.880
Just five more hours...

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:31.120
Lala!

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:35.790
Weren't you gonna wake up earlier to not waste your summer vacation?

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.830
I know! I know!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.540
Oh! I gotta hurry over to PriPara!

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:44.680
Thanks! I'm going out!

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:45.760
I'm visiting a friend!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.760
What about the radio exercises?

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:57.210
<i>As soon as I'm finished with my morning chores, I'll get to PriPara and perform.</i>

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:59.560
<i>So Eiko can see it!</i>

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:02.270
S-Sorry about that!

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:05.240
It's cosmic amounts of fine. No worries.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:16.460
<i>Is she from around here? What a pretty lady.</i>

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:18.830
Uhh... Morning Menu B.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.380
Capisce!

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.340
One order of B!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:27.710
<i>I can stop here at 10, so I'll have plenty of time to get to PriPara...</i>

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:28.800
Wel

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.510
COOOME!?

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.580
Morning Menu A please.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.970
Coming right up.

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:37.140
<i>She's seriously here again...</i>

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:40.310
Manaka. What time did you wake up this morning?

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.440
S-Six o'clock, ma'am.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:46.680
It's quite wonderful that you're waking up early to help out at home.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:48.570
Very good of you.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.910
Uh, thank you.

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:52.370
And you remember you are to stay out of PriPara?

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.640
Oh, of course I do.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.480
You're up soon, Eiko...

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.130
Yeah...

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.640
That was most delectable!

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.130
Would you like anything else?

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:14.100
<i>I'll miss her game for sure if I don't leave soon!</i>

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:15.810
<i>Hmm?</i>

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.230
<i>Very suspicious.</i>

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:26.410
<i>Eiko's opponent is crazy strong,
she needs any courage she can get!</i>

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:29.700
<i>And if my singing can help her even a little bit...</i>

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:31.230
<i>I have to sing!</i>

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.190
<i>But...</i>

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.260
Lala!

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:34.900
Hm?

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.370
Non!

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:40.180
Excuse me, could I get some water?

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.080
Coming!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:44.350
<i>She seems nervous... Hmm?</i>

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.500
<i>Oh, she's calmed down?</i>

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.720
<i>Perhaps I was overthinking it.</i>

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.250
Eiko, your match starts soon!

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:04.270
<i>Lala, where are you?</i>

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:07.700
Your opponent's already on the court.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.720
Come on, Eiko!

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.490
Yeah, gotcha.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:28.090
Love - 30!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.260
<i>I'll make it for sure, Eiko!</i>

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:32.870
<i>I promised!</i>

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:52.260
PriPara Change Complete!

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:57.280
Mireille!

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:58.740
You're late-pri!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:02.700
You need to be ready at least 4 hours ahead of time like me-kuma!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.400
You're overdoing it-pri!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:08.130
We have no time for comebacks-kuma! Get on with it-kuma!

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.470
Coord Change Start!

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:19.720
The highly popular Wonderland Series.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.470
Those pink stripes are made for you, Lala!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.350
Wonderland Macaron Dress!

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:31.820
And the rarer blue set fits Mireille very well!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.780
Wonderfully matching coordination.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.490
Wonderland Rabbit Dress-pri!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:53.710
<i>I hope you're watching, Eiko! We're singing for you!</i>

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:23.620
Love - 40!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.580
Don't mind it, Eiko!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:32.970
<i>I knew I had no chance. She's the captain!</i>

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.890
Eiko! Check it out!

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:59.280
Lala, thank you!

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:10.180
<i>I don't know why, but I feel like I can do anything when I hear her sing!</i>

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:13.790
<i>That's right! Have I forgotten all that practice?</i>

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.610
<i>Who cares if my opponent is strong?</i>

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:19.050
<i>I can't just let them scare me into submission before we even start!</i>

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.110
<i>And even if I lose...</i>

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:27.790
<i>I'm still gonna do my best and have fun, just like Lala!</i>

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:30.020
Twirly twirl!

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:32.020
What's in it?

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:40.030
Present For You!

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:42.400
15 - 40!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.450
All right!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.500
Cyalume Change!

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:36.880
Game set! Winner: Eiko!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:42.520
You did it!

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:43.340
I knew you had it in you!

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.350
Congrats, Eiko!

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:45.840
That was amazing!

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:50.060
Your performance gave her strength.

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:52.640
My performance...

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.650
Songs have that kind of power.

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:56.020
We'll have to keep working hard.

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:58.730
We'll catch up to Sophie yet.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:20:59.920
Yeah!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.510
Geez, you took forever!

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:06.570
Sowwy...

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:09.510
Anything else, Headmistress?

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.960
No, thank you.

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:14.970
You help out at home to an outright unexpected extent.

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:16.640
I'm very impressed.

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:18.550
Shucks.

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:21.920
Hooray!

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:24.880
<i>Manaka Lala.</i>

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:28.850
<i>Summer has only just begun.</i>

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:31.050
What a relief.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:33.060
Lala, could you go do some shopping for us?

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:35.020
Capisce!

00:23:05.640 --> 00:23:10.990
Sophie's dancing and singing is amazing, and she's always so cool and lovely!

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:16.360
If we're going to have a three person team, I want it to be with Sophie!

00:23:16.360 --> 00:23:17.040
Pri?

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:21.710
What are you on about? We're like apples and oranges! We're just peasants and she's the princess!

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:23.680
No way is that happening-pri!

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:27.140
I'll go plead with her in person!

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:28.510
Whaaat?!

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:32.060
Next time: I Wanna Sing With Sophie!

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:35.010
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
